      "message": "fix(test): docs-picture goldens move to the release snapshot lane\n\nSplit docs_images_match_the_rendered_steps: the non-pixel half stays in the\ndefault suite (docs_example_steps_through_operations); the PNG compare is\n#[ignore]d as docs_images_snapshot_match_the_rendered_steps and the release\nplan gains a gpu_render `--ignored snapshot` step (the old step is --lib\nonly). PROCESS_VERSION 13.\n\nFixes #854\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
